{
 "title": "POV: You Stop Spending for 30 Days\u2026 and Find $420 You Didn't Know YOU Had",
 "duration": 595.016,
 "scenes": [
  {
   "id": "s0",
   "visual": "sketch",
   "params": {},
   "heading": "",
   "start": 0.2,
   "end": 19.911,
   "line_starts": [
    0.2,
    5.79,
    9.949,
    14.225
   ],
   "subs": [
    {
     "start": 0.2,
     "end": 2.329,
     "text": "It's November first. You wake up,"
    },
    {
     "start": 2.329,
     "end": 3.748,
     "text": "make coffee at home..."
    },
    {
     "start": 3.748,
     "end": 5.49,
     "text": "and open a little notebook."
    },
    {
     "start": 5.79,
     "end": 7.985,
     "text": "On the first page you write three"
    },
    {
     "start": 7.985,
     "end": 9.649,
     "text": "words. No-Spend November."
    },
    {
     "start": 9.949,
     "end": 11.611,
     "text": "Thirty days. No extras."
    },
    {
     "start": 11.611,
     "end": 13.925,
     "text": "Only the things you really need."
    },
    {
     "start": 14.225,
     "end": 15.639,
     "text": "And by December first..."
    },
    {
     "start": 15.639,
     "end": 17.819,
     "text": "you'll have an extra four hundred and"
    },
    {
     "start": 17.819,
     "end": 19.411,
     "text": "twenty dollars in the bank."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s1",
   "visual": "sketch",
   "params": {},
   "heading": "",
   "start": 19.911,
   "end": 36.433,
   "line_starts": [
    19.911,
    23.292,
    28.935,
    33.433
   ],
   "subs": [
    {
     "start": 19.911,
     "end": 22.992,
     "text": "Your friend Mia is having a very different morning."
    },
    {
     "start": 23.292,
     "end": 25.715,
     "text": "Three packages are waiting at her door."
    },
    {
     "start": 25.715,
     "end": 28.635,
     "text": "She doesn't even remember ordering two of them."
    },
    {
     "start": 28.935,
     "end": 30.492,
     "text": "A phone case. A candle."
    },
    {
     "start": 30.492,
     "end": 33.133,
     "text": "Something called a 'mini waffle maker.'"
    },
    {
     "start": 33.433,
     "end": 35.933,
     "text": "And Black Friday hasn't even started yet."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s2",
   "visual": "sketch",
   "params": {},
   "heading": "",
   "start": 36.433,
   "end": 55.218,
   "line_starts": [
    36.433,
    39.963,
    48.803,
    52.597
   ],
   "subs": [
    {
     "start": 36.433,
     "end": 38.509,
     "text": "Here's the thing. Mia isn't bad with"
    },
    {
     "start": 38.509,
     "end": 39.663,
     "text": "money. She's normal."
    },
    {
     "start": 39.963,
     "end": 42.06,
     "text": "In a 2022 Slickdeals survey,"
    },
    {
     "start": 42.06,
     "end": 45.432,
     "text": "Americans said they spent about three hundred"
    },
    {
     "start": 45.432,
     "end": 48.503,
     "text": "fourteen dollars a month on impulse buys."
    },
    {
     "start": 48.803,
     "end": 52.297,
     "text": "That's three thousand seven hundred sixty-eight dollars a year."
    },
    {
     "start": 52.597,
     "end": 54.718,
     "text": "On things nobody planned to buy."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s3",
   "visual": "sketch",
   "params": {},
   "heading": "",
   "start": 55.218,
   "end": 59.38,
   "line_starts": [
    55.218,
    57.358
   ],
   "subs": [
    {
     "start": 55.218,
     "end": 57.058,
     "text": "And it never feels like a lot."
    },
    {
     "start": 57.358,
     "end": 58.88,
     "text": "It's the total that hurts."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s4",
   "visual": "sketch",
   "params": {},
   "heading": "",
   "start": 59.38,
   "end": 78.361,
   "line_starts": [
    59.38,
    61.353,
    64.365,
    69.081
   ],
   "subs": [
    {
     "start": 59.38,
     "end": 61.053,
     "text": "So why a no-spend month?"
    },
    {
     "start": 61.353,
     "end": 64.065,
     "text": "Because it's not about suffering for thirty days."
    },
    {
     "start": 64.365,
     "end": 66.215,
     "text": "It's a reset. You find out what"
    },
    {
     "start": 66.215,
     "end": 68.781,
     "text": "you really need... and what was just habit."
    },
    {
     "start": 69.081,
     "end": 70.568,
     "text": "And you're not alone."
    },
    {
     "start": 70.568,
     "end": 73.754,
     "text": "A Credit Karma survey found forty-two percent"
    },
    {
     "start": 73.754,
     "end": 77.861,
     "text": "of Americans were doing or considering a no-buy challenge."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s5",
   "visual": "sketch",
   "params": {},
   "heading": "",
   "start": 78.361,
   "end": 90.784,
   "line_starts": [
    78.361,
    80.847,
    83.879,
    87.184
   ],
   "subs": [
    {
     "start": 78.361,
     "end": 80.547,
     "text": "But most people fail by day five."
    },
    {
     "start": 80.847,
     "end": 83.579,
     "text": "They start with no plan. Just willpower."
    },
    {
     "start": 83.879,
     "end": 86.884,
     "text": "And willpower loses to a flash sale every time."
    },
    {
     "start": 87.184,
     "end": 89.478,
     "text": "So you're going to do it differently."
    },
    {
     "start": 89.478,
     "end": 90.284,
     "text": "Step by step."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s6",
   "visual": "sketch",
   "params": {},
   "heading": "",
   "start": 90.784,
   "end": 104.828,
   "line_starts": [
    90.784,
    93.783,
    97.081,
    102.325
   ],
   "subs": [
    {
     "start": 90.784,
     "end": 93.483,
     "text": "Step one. Write your rules before you start."
    },
    {
     "start": 93.783,
     "end": 95.337,
     "text": "On the left side of the page"
    },
    {
     "start": 95.337,
     "end": 96.781,
     "text": "you write: what's allowed."
    },
    {
     "start": 97.081,
     "end": 99.358,
     "text": "Rent. Bills. Groceries from a list."
    },
    {
     "start": 99.358,
     "end": 102.025,
     "text": "Gas. Medicine. Gifts you already planned."
    },
    {
     "start": 102.325,
     "end": 104.328,
     "text": "That's not spending. That's living."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s7",
   "visual": "sketch",
   "params": {},
   "heading": "",
   "start": 104.828,
   "end": 119.156,
   "line_starts": [
    104.828,
    107.033,
    112.389,
    115.123
   ],
   "subs": [
    {
     "start": 104.828,
     "end": 106.733,
     "text": "On the right side: what's paused."
    },
    {
     "start": 107.033,
     "end": 109.491,
     "text": "Takeout. Coffee shops. New clothes."
    },
    {
     "start": 109.491,
     "end": 112.089,
     "text": "Online shopping. Gadgets. Home decor."
    },
    {
     "start": 112.389,
     "end": 114.823,
     "text": "Not forever. Just for thirty days."
    },
    {
     "start": 115.123,
     "end": 117.664,
     "text": "Clear rules mean no arguing with yourself"
    },
    {
     "start": 117.664,
     "end": 118.656,
     "text": "at the checkout."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s8",
   "visual": "sketch",
   "params": {},
   "heading": "",
   "start": 119.156,
   "end": 130.07,
   "line_starts": [
    119.156,
    121.465,
    125.186,
    128.137
   ],
   "subs": [
    {
     "start": 119.156,
     "end": 120.448,
     "text": "And one more rule."
    },
    {
     "start": 120.448,
     "end": 121.165,
     "text": "A big one."
    },
    {
     "start": 121.465,
     "end": 123.669,
     "text": "If something breaks and you truly need"
    },
    {
     "start": 123.669,
     "end": 124.886,
     "text": "it... you replace it."
    },
    {
     "start": 125.186,
     "end": 127.837,
     "text": "A no-spend month isn't about being stubborn."
    },
    {
     "start": 128.137,
     "end": 129.57,
     "text": "It's about being honest."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s9",
   "visual": "sketch",
   "params": {},
   "heading": "",
   "start": 130.07,
   "end": 142.544,
   "line_starts": [
    130.07,
    131.669,
    133.737,
    140.365
   ],
   "subs": [
    {
     "start": 130.07,
     "end": 131.369,
     "text": "Then you set the goal."
    },
    {
     "start": 131.669,
     "end": 133.437,
     "text": "Where does the saved money go?"
    },
    {
     "start": 133.737,
     "end": 136.026,
     "text": "For you, it's your emergency fund."
    },
    {
     "start": 136.026,
     "end": 137.911,
     "text": "It's at six hundred dollars,"
    },
    {
     "start": 137.911,
     "end": 140.065,
     "text": "and you want it at one thousand."
    },
    {
     "start": 140.365,
     "end": 142.044,
     "text": "Now this month has a reason."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s10",
   "visual": "sketch",
   "params": {},
   "heading": "",
   "start": 142.544,
   "end": 156.158,
   "line_starts": [
    142.544,
    144.66,
    148.95,
    152.781
   ],
   "subs": [
    {
     "start": 142.544,
     "end": 144.359,
     "text": "Step two. The spending audit."
    },
    {
     "start": 144.66,
     "end": 146.848,
     "text": "You open your banking app and look"
    },
    {
     "start": 146.848,
     "end": 148.65,
     "text": "at last October. Every line."
    },
    {
     "start": 148.95,
     "end": 151.344,
     "text": "You grab a highlighter and mark anything"
    },
    {
     "start": 151.344,
     "end": 152.481,
     "text": "that wasn't a need."
    },
    {
     "start": 152.781,
     "end": 154.162,
     "text": "It takes twenty minutes."
    },
    {
     "start": 154.162,
     "end": 155.658,
     "text": "And it's a little painful."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s11",
   "visual": "sketch",
   "params": {},
   "heading": "",
   "start": 156.158,
   "end": 167.839,
   "line_starts": [
    156.158,
    158.744,
    161.478,
    164.775
   ],
   "subs": [
    {
     "start": 156.158,
     "end": 158.444,
     "text": "Coffee shops: sixty-two dollars."
    },
    {
     "start": 158.744,
     "end": 161.178,
     "text": "Delivery apps: one hundred eighteen."
    },
    {
     "start": 161.478,
     "end": 164.475,
     "text": "Online orders you forgot about: ninety-four."
    },
    {
     "start": 164.775,
     "end": 167.339,
     "text": "Random stuff at the store: seventy-one."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s12",
   "visual": "sketch",
   "params": {},
   "heading": "",
   "start": 167.839,
   "end": 179.764,
   "line_starts": [
    167.839,
    171.309,
    173.159,
    174.969
   ],
   "subs": [
    {
     "start": 167.839,
     "end": 170.113,
     "text": "Three hundred forty-five dollars."
    },
    {
     "start": 170.113,
     "end": 171.009,
     "text": "In one month."
    },
    {
     "start": 171.309,
     "end": 172.859,
     "text": "And you couldn't name half of it."
    },
    {
     "start": 173.159,
     "end": 174.669,
     "text": "That's the moment it clicks."
    },
    {
     "start": 174.969,
     "end": 177.546,
     "text": "This money isn't gone because you're poor."
    },
    {
     "start": 177.546,
     "end": 179.264,
     "text": "It's gone because it's easy."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s13",
   "visual": "sketch",
   "params": {},
   "heading": "",
   "start": 179.764,
   "end": 193.009,
   "line_starts": [
    179.764,
    181.839,
    186.571,
    189.81
   ],
   "subs": [
    {
     "start": 179.764,
     "end": 181.539,
     "text": "Step three. Close the doors."
    },
    {
     "start": 181.839,
     "end": 184.419,
     "text": "Spending is easy because stores make it"
    },
    {
     "start": 184.419,
     "end": 186.271,
     "text": "easy. So you make it harder."
    },
    {
     "start": 186.571,
     "end": 189.51,
     "text": "First, you unsubscribe from every store email."
    },
    {
     "start": 189.81,
     "end": 192.509,
     "text": "Thirty-one of them. It feels amazing."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s14",
   "visual": "sketch",
   "params": {},
   "heading": "",
   "start": 193.009,
   "end": 206.177,
   "line_starts": [
    193.009,
    197.185,
    202.895
   ],
   "subs": [
    {
     "start": 193.009,
     "end": 195.36,
     "text": "Next, you delete your saved card from"
    },
    {
     "start": 195.36,
     "end": 196.885,
     "text": "shopping sites and apps."
    },
    {
     "start": 197.185,
     "end": 199.65,
     "text": "Now every purchase means getting up,"
    },
    {
     "start": 199.65,
     "end": 202.595,
     "text": "finding your wallet, typing sixteen digits."
    },
    {
     "start": 202.895,
     "end": 204.692,
     "text": "And a minute is often enough to"
    },
    {
     "start": 204.692,
     "end": 205.677,
     "text": "change your mind."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s15",
   "visual": "sketch",
   "params": {},
   "heading": "",
   "start": 206.177,
   "end": 220.326,
   "line_starts": [
    206.177,
    209.432,
    214.286,
    216.694
   ],
   "subs": [
    {
     "start": 206.177,
     "end": 209.132,
     "text": "Then you turn off notifications from shopping apps."
    },
    {
     "start": 209.432,
     "end": 211.449,
     "text": "And you move them off your home"
    },
    {
     "start": 211.449,
     "end": 212.88,
     "text": "screen. Into a folder."
    },
    {
     "start": 212.88,
     "end": 213.986,
     "text": "On the last page."
    },
    {
     "start": 214.286,
     "end": 216.394,
     "text": "Out of sight... really is out of mind."
    },
    {
     "start": 216.694,
     "end": 218.821,
     "text": "Mia? She has eleven shopping apps on"
    },
    {
     "start": 218.821,
     "end": 219.826,
     "text": "her first screen."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s16",
   "visual": "sketch",
   "params": {},
   "heading": "",
   "start": 220.326,
   "end": 231.576,
   "line_starts": [
    220.326,
    222.227,
    225.437,
    229.714
   ],
   "subs": [
    {
     "start": 220.326,
     "end": 221.927,
     "text": "Step four. The wish list."
    },
    {
     "start": 222.227,
     "end": 223.656,
     "text": "You will still want things."
    },
    {
     "start": 223.656,
     "end": 225.137,
     "text": "That's normal. You're human."
    },
    {
     "start": 225.437,
     "end": 227.426,
     "text": "So when you see something you want,"
    },
    {
     "start": 227.426,
     "end": 228.392,
     "text": "you don't buy it."
    },
    {
     "start": 228.392,
     "end": 229.414,
     "text": "You write it down."
    },
    {
     "start": 229.714,
     "end": 231.076,
     "text": "Name. Price. Date."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s17",
   "visual": "sketch",
   "params": {},
   "heading": "",
   "start": 231.576,
   "end": 246.831,
   "line_starts": [
    231.576,
    235.034,
    238.018,
    242.963
   ],
   "subs": [
    {
     "start": 231.576,
     "end": 234.734,
     "text": "Day three: a wool jacket. Eighty-nine dollars."
    },
    {
     "start": 235.034,
     "end": 237.718,
     "text": "Day eight: wireless earbuds. Fifty-nine."
    },
    {
     "start": 238.018,
     "end": 242.663,
     "text": "Day twelve: a board game everybody's talking about. Forty-five."
    },
    {
     "start": 242.963,
     "end": 244.388,
     "text": "Your list gets longer."
    },
    {
     "start": 244.388,
     "end": 246.331,
     "text": "And something strange happens."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s18",
   "visual": "sketch",
   "params": {},
   "heading": "",
   "start": 246.831,
   "end": 258.223,
   "line_starts": [
    246.831,
    249.834,
    253.19,
    255.374
   ],
   "subs": [
    {
     "start": 246.831,
     "end": 248.183,
     "text": "By the end of the month,"
    },
    {
     "start": 248.183,
     "end": 249.534,
     "text": "you read the list again."
    },
    {
     "start": 249.834,
     "end": 251.275,
     "text": "And most of the things..."
    },
    {
     "start": 251.275,
     "end": 252.89,
     "text": "you don't even want anymore."
    },
    {
     "start": 253.19,
     "end": 255.074,
     "text": "The jacket? You already have two."
    },
    {
     "start": 255.374,
     "end": 257.723,
     "text": "The wanting faded. The money stayed."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s19",
   "visual": "sketch",
   "params": {},
   "heading": "",
   "start": 258.223,
   "end": 274.743,
   "line_starts": [
    258.223,
    262.954,
    267.589,
    270.325
   ],
   "subs": [
    {
     "start": 258.223,
     "end": 260.896,
     "text": "Step five. Food. Because this is where"
    },
    {
     "start": 260.896,
     "end": 262.654,
     "text": "most no-spend months die."
    },
    {
     "start": 262.954,
     "end": 264.888,
     "text": "It's seven p.m. You're tired."
    },
    {
     "start": 264.888,
     "end": 267.289,
     "text": "And the delivery app is right there."
    },
    {
     "start": 267.589,
     "end": 270.025,
     "text": "So on Sunday, you plan five dinners."
    },
    {
     "start": 270.325,
     "end": 272.18,
     "text": "One grocery trip. One list."
    },
    {
     "start": 272.18,
     "end": 274.243,
     "text": "Nothing else goes in the cart."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s20",
   "visual": "sketch",
   "params": {},
   "heading": "",
   "start": 274.743,
   "end": 286.135,
   "line_starts": [
    274.743,
    277.305,
    280.348,
    283.08
   ],
   "subs": [
    {
     "start": 274.743,
     "end": 277.005,
     "text": "You cook double on Sunday and Wednesday."
    },
    {
     "start": 277.305,
     "end": 280.048,
     "text": "Chili. Pasta bake. A big pot of soup."
    },
    {
     "start": 280.348,
     "end": 282.78,
     "text": "Leftovers go in the freezer, labeled."
    },
    {
     "start": 283.08,
     "end": 285.635,
     "text": "So 'nothing to eat' is never true again."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s21",
   "visual": "sketch",
   "params": {},
   "heading": "",
   "start": 286.135,
   "end": 298.634,
   "line_starts": [
    286.135,
    290.075,
    293.665,
    296.132
   ],
   "subs": [
    {
     "start": 286.135,
     "end": 287.567,
     "text": "And for the hard nights,"
    },
    {
     "start": 287.567,
     "end": 289.775,
     "text": "you make a 'lazy list' on the fridge."
    },
    {
     "start": 290.075,
     "end": 293.365,
     "text": "Eggs on toast. Quesadillas. Frozen dumplings."
    },
    {
     "start": 293.665,
     "end": 295.832,
     "text": "Ten minutes, about two dollars a plate."
    },
    {
     "start": 296.132,
     "end": 298.134,
     "text": "Cheaper than delivery fees alone."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s22",
   "visual": "sketch",
   "params": {},
   "heading": "",
   "start": 298.634,
   "end": 310.21,
   "line_starts": [
    298.634,
    301.793,
    305.251,
    307.885
   ],
   "subs": [
    {
     "start": 298.634,
     "end": 301.493,
     "text": "Meanwhile, Mia orders dinner four times a week."
    },
    {
     "start": 301.793,
     "end": 303.674,
     "text": "Twenty-eight dollars a time,"
    },
    {
     "start": 303.674,
     "end": 304.951,
     "text": "after fees and tip."
    },
    {
     "start": 305.251,
     "end": 307.585,
     "text": "That's over four hundred dollars a month."
    },
    {
     "start": 307.885,
     "end": 309.71,
     "text": "For food that arrives cold."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s23",
   "visual": "sketch",
   "params": {},
   "heading": "",
   "start": 310.21,
   "end": 323.301,
   "line_starts": [
    310.21,
    313.909,
    315.821,
    319.198
   ],
   "subs": [
    {
     "start": 310.21,
     "end": 312.035,
     "text": "Coffee? You buy a bag of good"
    },
    {
     "start": 312.035,
     "end": 313.609,
     "text": "beans for twelve dollars."
    },
    {
     "start": 313.909,
     "end": 315.521,
     "text": "It makes about thirty cups."
    },
    {
     "start": 315.821,
     "end": 317.219,
     "text": "Forty cents a cup..."
    },
    {
     "start": 317.219,
     "end": 318.898,
     "text": "instead of five dollars."
    },
    {
     "start": 319.198,
     "end": 321.6,
     "text": "And honestly? It tastes like a small"
    },
    {
     "start": 321.6,
     "end": 322.801,
     "text": "win every morning."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s24",
   "visual": "sketch",
   "params": {},
   "heading": "",
   "start": 323.301,
   "end": 339.464,
   "line_starts": [
    323.301,
    328.76,
    331.412,
    336.413
   ],
   "subs": [
    {
     "start": 323.301,
     "end": 324.644,
     "text": "Step six. Free fun."
    },
    {
     "start": 324.644,
     "end": 328.46,
     "text": "Because a no-spend month can't feel like a punishment."
    },
    {
     "start": 328.76,
     "end": 330.328,
     "text": "So you make a list of free"
    },
    {
     "start": 330.328,
     "end": 331.112,
     "text": "things to do."
    },
    {
     "start": 331.412,
     "end": 333.175,
     "text": "Long walks. The library."
    },
    {
     "start": 333.175,
     "end": 334.497,
     "text": "A free museum day."
    },
    {
     "start": 334.497,
     "end": 336.113,
     "text": "A movie night at home."
    },
    {
     "start": 336.413,
     "end": 338.964,
     "text": "Board games you already own. All free."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s25",
   "visual": "sketch",
   "params": {},
   "heading": "",
   "start": 339.464,
   "end": 352.656,
   "line_starts": [
    339.464,
    342.281,
    346.21,
    348.875
   ],
   "subs": [
    {
     "start": 339.464,
     "end": 341.981,
     "text": "The library becomes your favorite place."
    },
    {
     "start": 342.281,
     "end": 345.91,
     "text": "Books, movies, even audiobooks on your phone. All free."
    },
    {
     "start": 346.21,
     "end": 348.575,
     "text": "You read more in November than all summer."
    },
    {
     "start": 348.875,
     "end": 350.713,
     "text": "It doesn't feel like losing."
    },
    {
     "start": 350.713,
     "end": 352.156,
     "text": "It feels like finding."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s26",
   "visual": "sketch",
   "params": {},
   "heading": "",
   "start": 352.656,
   "end": 365.092,
   "line_starts": [
    352.656,
    355.615,
    360.2,
    363.169
   ],
   "subs": [
    {
     "start": 352.656,
     "end": 355.315,
     "text": "Friends invite you to a forty-dollar brunch."
    },
    {
     "start": 355.615,
     "end": 356.686,
     "text": "You don't say no."
    },
    {
     "start": 356.686,
     "end": 358.64,
     "text": "You say, 'Come to mine instead."
    },
    {
     "start": 358.64,
     "end": 359.9,
     "text": "I'll make pancakes.'"
    },
    {
     "start": 360.2,
     "end": 362.869,
     "text": "Six people. Eight dollars of ingredients."
    },
    {
     "start": 363.169,
     "end": 364.592,
     "text": "Best brunch of the year."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s27",
   "visual": "sketch",
   "params": {},
   "heading": "",
   "start": 365.092,
   "end": 376.575,
   "line_starts": [
    365.092,
    368.03,
    372.623
   ],
   "subs": [
    {
     "start": 365.092,
     "end": 367.73,
     "text": "Step seven. And this is the secret one."
    },
    {
     "start": 368.03,
     "end": 370.121,
     "text": "Every day you don't spend on extras..."
    },
    {
     "start": 370.121,
     "end": 372.323,
     "text": "you move the money you would have spent."
    },
    {
     "start": 372.623,
     "end": 374.556,
     "text": "Just ten or fifteen dollars."
    },
    {
     "start": 374.556,
     "end": 376.075,
     "text": "Straight into savings."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s28",
   "visual": "sketch",
   "params": {},
   "heading": "",
   "start": 376.575,
   "end": 391.292,
   "line_starts": [
    376.575,
    379.644,
    381.999,
    386.568
   ],
   "subs": [
    {
     "start": 376.575,
     "end": 378.196,
     "text": "You also mark a big X on"
    },
    {
     "start": 378.196,
     "end": 379.344,
     "text": "a paper calendar."
    },
    {
     "start": 379.644,
     "end": 381.699,
     "text": "One X for every no-spend day."
    },
    {
     "start": 381.999,
     "end": 383.646,
     "text": "By week two, the row of X's"
    },
    {
     "start": 383.646,
     "end": 386.268,
     "text": "is so pretty... you don't want to break it."
    },
    {
     "start": 386.568,
     "end": 389.291,
     "text": "That's the trick. You're not fighting temptation."
    },
    {
     "start": 389.291,
     "end": 390.792,
     "text": "You're protecting a streak."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s29",
   "visual": "sketch",
   "params": {},
   "heading": "",
   "start": 391.292,
   "end": 405.799,
   "line_starts": [
    391.292,
    393.244,
    398.618,
    400.515
   ],
   "subs": [
    {
     "start": 391.292,
     "end": 392.944,
     "text": "Week two is the hardest."
    },
    {
     "start": 393.244,
     "end": 394.759,
     "text": "The excitement is gone."
    },
    {
     "start": 394.759,
     "end": 396.868,
     "text": "Payday arrives. Your brain says,"
    },
    {
     "start": 396.868,
     "end": 398.318,
     "text": "'You deserve a treat.'"
    },
    {
     "start": 398.618,
     "end": 400.215,
     "text": "And you do deserve a treat."
    },
    {
     "start": 400.515,
     "end": 402.088,
     "text": "So you take a long bath,"
    },
    {
     "start": 402.088,
     "end": 404.185,
     "text": "call your mom, and watch a movie"
    },
    {
     "start": 404.185,
     "end": 405.299,
     "text": "you already have."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s30",
   "visual": "sketch",
   "params": {},
   "heading": "",
   "start": 405.799,
   "end": 417.678,
   "line_starts": [
    405.799,
    409.272,
    412.248,
    415.873
   ],
   "subs": [
    {
     "start": 405.799,
     "end": 406.903,
     "text": "And if you slip?"
    },
    {
     "start": 406.903,
     "end": 408.972,
     "text": "One coffee, one impulse snack?"
    },
    {
     "start": 409.272,
     "end": 411.112,
     "text": "You don't quit. You write it down"
    },
    {
     "start": 411.112,
     "end": 411.948,
     "text": "and keep going."
    },
    {
     "start": 412.248,
     "end": 415.573,
     "text": "A no-spend month with three slips still saves hundreds."
    },
    {
     "start": 415.873,
     "end": 417.178,
     "text": "Quitting saves nothing."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s31",
   "visual": "sketch",
   "params": {},
   "heading": "",
   "start": 417.678,
   "end": 429.721,
   "line_starts": [
    417.678,
    420.028,
    421.336,
    425.886
   ],
   "subs": [
    {
     "start": 417.678,
     "end": 419.728,
     "text": "Then... the last week of November."
    },
    {
     "start": 420.028,
     "end": 421.036,
     "text": "Black Friday."
    },
    {
     "start": 421.336,
     "end": 423.051,
     "text": "Every app, every TV ad,"
    },
    {
     "start": 423.051,
     "end": 425.586,
     "text": "every email screams 'Last chance!'"
    },
    {
     "start": 425.886,
     "end": 429.221,
     "text": "This year, Black Friday is November twenty-seventh."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s32",
   "visual": "sketch",
   "params": {},
   "heading": "",
   "start": 429.721,
   "end": 445.524,
   "line_starts": [
    429.721,
    432.003,
    435.509,
    440.271
   ],
   "subs": [
    {
     "start": 429.721,
     "end": 431.703,
     "text": "But you planned for this on day one."
    },
    {
     "start": 432.003,
     "end": 434.293,
     "text": "Black Friday is your one exception."
    },
    {
     "start": 434.293,
     "end": 435.209,
     "text": "With one rule."
    },
    {
     "start": 435.509,
     "end": 437.583,
     "text": "You can buy only what was already"
    },
    {
     "start": 437.583,
     "end": 439.971,
     "text": "on your list. Before the sale started."
    },
    {
     "start": 440.271,
     "end": 441.919,
     "text": "You need new winter boots."
    },
    {
     "start": 441.919,
     "end": 443.757,
     "text": "So you check the price now..."
    },
    {
     "start": 443.757,
     "end": 445.024,
     "text": "and again on Friday."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s33",
   "visual": "sketch",
   "params": {},
   "heading": "",
   "start": 445.524,
   "end": 458.779,
   "line_starts": [
    445.524,
    449.273,
    452.259,
    455.693
   ],
   "subs": [
    {
     "start": 445.524,
     "end": 447.673,
     "text": "The boots drop from one hundred twenty"
    },
    {
     "start": 447.673,
     "end": 448.973,
     "text": "dollars to eighty-four."
    },
    {
     "start": 449.273,
     "end": 450.549,
     "text": "You buy them. Done."
    },
    {
     "start": 450.549,
     "end": 451.959,
     "text": "You close the laptop."
    },
    {
     "start": 452.259,
     "end": 455.393,
     "text": "No 'while I'm here.' No 'free shipping over fifty.'"
    },
    {
     "start": 455.693,
     "end": 458.279,
     "text": "Thirty-six dollars saved. On purpose."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s34",
   "visual": "sketch",
   "params": {},
   "heading": "",
   "start": 458.779,
   "end": 473.316,
   "line_starts": [
    458.779,
    460.798,
    463.617,
    470.206
   ],
   "subs": [
    {
     "start": 458.779,
     "end": 460.498,
     "text": "Mia has a Black Friday too."
    },
    {
     "start": 460.798,
     "end": 462.237,
     "text": "She doesn't have a list."
    },
    {
     "start": 462.237,
     "end": 463.317,
     "text": "She has a feeling."
    },
    {
     "start": 463.617,
     "end": 465.345,
     "text": "A TV she didn't plan for."
    },
    {
     "start": 465.345,
     "end": 468.316,
     "text": "Three sweaters. A smart speaker 'because it"
    },
    {
     "start": 468.316,
     "end": 469.906,
     "text": "was forty percent off.'"
    },
    {
     "start": 470.206,
     "end": 472.816,
     "text": "Six hundred dollars. On a credit card."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s35",
   "visual": "sketch",
   "params": {},
   "heading": "",
   "start": 473.316,
   "end": 486.991,
   "line_starts": [
    473.316,
    475.173,
    479.843,
    482.895
   ],
   "subs": [
    {
     "start": 473.316,
     "end": 474.873,
     "text": "And here's why that matters."
    },
    {
     "start": 475.173,
     "end": 476.796,
     "text": "If she pays it off slowly,"
    },
    {
     "start": 476.796,
     "end": 479.543,
     "text": "at a credit card rate over twenty percent..."
    },
    {
     "start": 479.843,
     "end": 482.595,
     "text": "those 'deals' get more expensive every month."
    },
    {
     "start": 482.895,
     "end": 485.222,
     "text": "A discount on a credit card isn't"
    },
    {
     "start": 485.222,
     "end": 486.491,
     "text": "always a discount."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s36",
   "visual": "sketch",
   "params": {},
   "heading": "",
   "start": 486.991,
   "end": 503.605,
   "line_starts": [
    486.991,
    490.88,
    495.534,
    500.783
   ],
   "subs": [
    {
     "start": 486.991,
     "end": 489.364,
     "text": "December first. You open your notebook."
    },
    {
     "start": 489.364,
     "end": 490.58,
     "text": "And you do the math."
    },
    {
     "start": 490.88,
     "end": 495.234,
     "text": "Last October, your extras cost three hundred forty-five dollars."
    },
    {
     "start": 495.534,
     "end": 497.813,
     "text": "This November, you spent fifty-one."
    },
    {
     "start": 497.813,
     "end": 500.483,
     "text": "A few slips, plus the boots on your list."
    },
    {
     "start": 500.783,
     "end": 502.331,
     "text": "And the daily transfers?"
    },
    {
     "start": 502.331,
     "end": 503.105,
     "text": "They add up."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s37",
   "visual": "sketch",
   "params": {},
   "heading": "",
   "start": 503.605,
   "end": 518.164,
   "line_starts": [
    503.605,
    508.342,
    512.365,
    514.756
   ],
   "subs": [
    {
     "start": 503.605,
     "end": 505.859,
     "text": "Four hundred and twenty dollars."
    },
    {
     "start": 505.859,
     "end": 508.042,
     "text": "Moved into your emergency fund."
    },
    {
     "start": 508.342,
     "end": 510.711,
     "text": "Your six hundred dollars is now one"
    },
    {
     "start": 510.711,
     "end": 512.065,
     "text": "thousand and twenty."
    },
    {
     "start": 512.365,
     "end": 514.456,
     "text": "Goal reached. One month early."
    },
    {
     "start": 514.756,
     "end": 516.489,
     "text": "Not because you earned more."
    },
    {
     "start": 516.489,
     "end": 517.664,
     "text": "Because you paused."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s38",
   "visual": "sketch",
   "params": {},
   "heading": "",
   "start": 518.164,
   "end": 531.25,
   "line_starts": [
    518.164,
    522.174,
    524.238,
    527.384
   ],
   "subs": [
    {
     "start": 518.164,
     "end": 521.874,
     "text": "Mia's November? Over one thousand dollars on extras."
    },
    {
     "start": 522.174,
     "end": 523.938,
     "text": "Most of it on her card."
    },
    {
     "start": 524.238,
     "end": 527.084,
     "text": "And she feels like the month just... disappeared."
    },
    {
     "start": 527.384,
     "end": 528.77,
     "text": "Same paycheck as you."
    },
    {
     "start": 528.77,
     "end": 530.75,
     "text": "Completely different December."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s39",
   "visual": "sketch",
   "params": {},
   "heading": "",
   "start": 531.25,
   "end": 542.964,
   "line_starts": [
    531.25,
    533.363,
    539.587
   ],
   "subs": [
    {
     "start": 531.25,
     "end": 533.063,
     "text": "But the best part isn't the money."
    },
    {
     "start": 533.363,
     "end": 535.81,
     "text": "You found out you don't miss delivery."
    },
    {
     "start": 535.81,
     "end": 537.162,
     "text": "You love the library."
    },
    {
     "start": 537.162,
     "end": 539.287,
     "text": "And coffee at home tastes better."
    },
    {
     "start": 539.587,
     "end": 542.464,
     "text": "These new habits don't end on December first."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s40",
   "visual": "sketch",
   "params": {},
   "heading": "",
   "start": 542.964,
   "end": 556.24,
   "line_starts": [
    542.964,
    544.708,
    548.844,
    553.189
   ],
   "subs": [
    {
     "start": 542.964,
     "end": 544.408,
     "text": "So you keep three of them."
    },
    {
     "start": 544.708,
     "end": 547.219,
     "text": "The wish list. The Sunday food plan."
    },
    {
     "start": 547.219,
     "end": 548.544,
     "text": "And no saved cards."
    },
    {
     "start": 548.844,
     "end": 551.062,
     "text": "Even half of those savings is over"
    },
    {
     "start": 551.062,
     "end": 552.889,
     "text": "two thousand dollars a year."
    },
    {
     "start": 553.189,
     "end": 555.74,
     "text": "That's the real win of No-Spend November."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s41",
   "visual": "sketch",
   "params": {},
   "heading": "",
   "start": 556.24,
   "end": 569.089,
   "line_starts": [
    556.24,
    559.755,
    564.543
   ],
   "subs": [
    {
     "start": 556.24,
     "end": 557.245,
     "text": "Want to try it?"
    },
    {
     "start": 557.245,
     "end": 559.455,
     "text": "Start today. It's November first."
    },
    {
     "start": 559.755,
     "end": 561.801,
     "text": "Write your rules. Do the audit."
    },
    {
     "start": 561.801,
     "end": 564.243,
     "text": "Close the doors. Start the wish list."
    },
    {
     "start": 564.543,
     "end": 566.566,
     "text": "Plan your food. Make a free fun"
    },
    {
     "start": 566.566,
     "end": 568.589,
     "text": "list. Move the money every day."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s42",
   "visual": "sketch",
   "params": {},
   "heading": "",
   "start": 569.089,
   "end": 581.537,
   "line_starts": [
    569.089,
    573.745,
    577.869
   ],
   "subs": [
    {
     "start": 569.089,
     "end": 571.62,
     "text": "And remember, these numbers are an example."
    },
    {
     "start": 571.62,
     "end": 573.445,
     "text": "Your month will look different."
    },
    {
     "start": 573.745,
     "end": 576.27,
     "text": "Maybe you save one hundred dollars."
    },
    {
     "start": 576.27,
     "end": 577.569,
     "text": "Maybe six hundred."
    },
    {
     "start": 577.869,
     "end": 579.879,
     "text": "Every dollar you keep is a dollar"
    },
    {
     "start": 579.879,
     "end": 581.037,
     "text": "that works for you."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s43",
   "visual": "sketch",
   "params": {},
   "heading": "",
   "start": 581.537,
   "end": 595.016,
   "line_starts": [
    581.537,
    585.503,
    589.893
   ],
   "subs": [
